<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania April jobless falls slightly to 5.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuania April jobless falls slightly to 5.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's Labour exchange said</p>
<p>on Tuesday that the unemployment rate in April went down to 5.9</p>
<p>percent from 6.2 percent in March.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     April '97   March '97   April '96</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)     5.9	   6.2	   8.0</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	  104,174     108,193     139,631</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom, +370 2 223 517</p>
</text>
